{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"6735","name":"络紫","desc":"络紫","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/06/11/160491137/7b739a1568758db1eed4e0f9ff6e45a3_8784230436753677286.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"络紫","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"女\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"璃月港\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"3.7活动「决斗！召唤之巅！」\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"职业\",\"value\":[\"冒险家\"]}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"编者注：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动「零时召唤」、「恒动械画」管理员。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/06/11/160491137/01eb11adb948eb71597f7afada239157_4825641842713388958.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"NPC截图\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/06/11/160491137/1ff18795234cb6dd9cd79d791daf3358_8911150857621362666.png\"},{\"tab_name\":\"位置\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/06/11/160491137/56117212d62f55a93f6c4d245e907274_4708427405362168310.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"商品列表","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e这「召唤王大奖赛」还真是吸引了不少人啊···\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e旅行者？你也是来参加这个比赛的吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【关于「零时召唤」···】——打开活动界面\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e喔？你是想要玩这个啊，没问题。要组建牌组的话请来这边。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e对了，你的对手是「虹雨」，对局要加油喔。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e这个「零时召唤」居然这么热门，嗯···总感觉这里面有一点点商机···\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e咳···请您在这边组建卡牌，需要我帮忙的话，招呼一声就好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【行秋】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e原来是你要和我对局吗？太好了，我正想找个强手切磋呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。】——进行对局\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【暂时有别的事···】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【行秋】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e这「七圣召唤」比赛，要「过关斩将」可真不容易。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【关于「械画」···】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e「械画」？您说的是那种可以拆解再拼接的机关画吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e我身边的这幅就是，前几天协会刚刚送过来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e如果您有兴趣的话，可以直接去试试拼接。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【还有别的事···】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e嗯，在「召唤王大奖赛」期间，我会一直待在这里照顾摊子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e你有什么问题，直接过来找我就好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\",\"list\":[]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1212","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"i